Package: shinyreact
Title: Shiny UI Infrastructure for JSON-Driven React Rendering
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Posit Software, PBC", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "info@posit.co")
Description: Server-side plumbing for rendering React component trees from
    Shiny. Provides the 'app.R' pattern (UI described as R objects) and the
    'ui.tsx' pattern (UI defined in a client React bundle). Ships no UI
    components; downstream packages register their own.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    cli,
    htmltools,
    jsonlite,
    S7,
    shiny (>= 1.13.0)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/posit-dev/shinyreact
BugReports: https://github.com/posit-dev/shinyreact/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
